%F A398594 Equals 2*G^2 - 3*log(2)*Pi*G/4 + 1055*zeta(4)/256 - 93*log(2)*zeta(3)/64 + 21*log(2)^2*zeta(2)/32 - log(2)^4/32 - 3*Pi*Im(Li_3((1+i)/2))/2, where G is Catalan's constant (A006752), and i is the imaginary unit.
